g=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"wp-image-52\" style=\"width: 150px;\" src=\"http://localhost/dinamica_suerte_virtual_base/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Publicidad-Model-Bolivia.jpg\" alt=\"\"></h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns gutenify-section-4f31d1b0-8e69-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-28f84493 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column gutenify-section-52e8bf30-8e69-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:25%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n</div><div class=\"swiper-button-next\"></div>\n		<div class=\"swiper-button-prev\"></div></div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-foreground-background-color has-background gutenify-section-4635dba0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-d794d2f0 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull gutenify-section-462f9a10-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim wp-block-cover__gradient-background has-background-gradient\" style=\"background-color:#8075a7;background:linear-gradient(93deg,rgb(0,0,0) 38%,rgba(46,42,48,0.08) 94%)\"></span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2245\" height=\"1587\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-79\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://localhost/dinamica_suerte_virtual_base/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/Colorful-Futuristic-Technology-Poster.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide gutenify-section-4627f8f0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-background-color has-text-color gutenify-section-4621de70-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\" style=\"padding-top:150px;padding-bottom:150px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left  animated animated-fadeInUp has-primary-color has-text-color gutenify-section-45f1cdc0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Dinámica de Suerte Virtual de Model Bolivia que te dejara ganar siempre </p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading alignwide has-text-align-left animated animated-fadeInUp has-gigantic-font-size gutenify-section-45fa0b20-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\" style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">	Participa y Gana Siempre </h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group gutenify-section-460ca8c0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-layout-flow wp-container-core-group-is-layout-47e5a185 wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left  animated animated-fadeInUp gutenify-section-46004cb0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Tu elijes la modalidad que deseas participar y ser parte de esta hermosa dinámica.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons animated fadeInUp gutenify-section-461b00a0-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97 is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-f105dac6 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\" style=\"margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:20px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill animated animated-fadeInUp gutenify-section-4614e620-8e74-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-right:35px;padding-left:35px\"> Quiero Participar </a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-service alignfull gutenify-service-layout-1 gutenify-service-col-2 gutenify-service-version-2 gutenify-section-45c7a6f0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-service-block\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-info-box gutenify-info-box-layout-1 gutenify-info-box-version-2 has-shadow-dark gutenify-section-4641b8f0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-46894940-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-title gutenify-section-468aa8d0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Info box</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-subtitle gutenify-section-468d40e0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Dinámica de Suerte Virtual</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-content gutenify-section-468ea070-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Participa personalmente en esta dinámica, te encantara saber que puedes ganar buscando muchas combinaciones de números que te llevaran a ser el ganador</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-buttons is-content-justification-center wp-block-buttons gutenify-buttons-version-2 gutenify-section-468fd8f0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-button wp-block-button gutenify-button-version-2 gutenify-section-46e991b0-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><a class=\"gutenify-button-link wp-block-button__link\"><span>Participar como Moderador </span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-info-box gutenify-info-box-layout-1 gutenify-info-box-version-2 has-shadow-dark gutenify-section-4642f170-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-46911170-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-title gutenify-section-46927100-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Info box</h3>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-subtitle gutenify-section-4693d090-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Servicio de Dinámica para Redes Sociales </h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center gutenify-admin-info-box-block-content gutenify-section-4694e200-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">Puedes contratar este servicio de acuerdo a las modalidades de juego que requieras para los participantes, desde un sorteo hasta juegos de apuesta y otros </p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-buttons is-content-justification-center wp-block-buttons gutenify-buttons-version-2 gutenify-section-46961a80-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-button wp-block-button gutenify-button-version-2 gutenify-section-46eb3f60-8e68-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><a class=\"gutenify-button-link wp-block-button__link\"><span>Contratar para mi  Negocio</span></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-c46bd840-8e73-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-ce7545b0-8e73-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-d1eb3290-8e73-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-icon flex-col-item is-content-justification-center gutenify-icon-version-2 gutenify-section-d69be960-8e73-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"gutenify-icon-wrapper\"><i class=\"fas fa-star\"></i></div></div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed alignfull is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio gutenify-section-c2249670-8e6a-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"si este mes iniciamos la primavera con todo.whatsapp +59165641452\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JJ9tnJfWPXU?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Gana Siempre con esta Dinámica de Suerte Virtual&#8230;.</figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity gutenify-section-424d9400-8e6b-11ef-8d43-1563d6feca97\"/>\n</div>\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"wp-block-template-part\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color gutenify-section-e7f32870-7de5-11ef-82f7-e53f9fd7b5c7 wp-elements-a250318617ff6ed0825aeae101852623 is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-75a7be9c wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"background-color:#222222;padding-top:25px;padding-right:25px;padding-bottom:25px;padding-left:25px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide gutenify-section-e7f12ca0-7de5-11ef-82f7-e53f9fd7b5c7 is-content-justification-space-between is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6c756ad3 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-social-links has-small-icon-size has-icon-color is-style-logos-only gutenify-section-e7e9d9a0-7de5-11ef-82f7-e53f9fd7b5c7 is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-social-links-is-layout-75ad2d25 wp-block-social-links-is-layout-flex\"><li style=\"color: #ffffff; \" class=\"wp-social-link wp-social-link-facebook has-background-color wp-block-social-link\"><a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"#\" class=\"wp-block-social-link-anchor\"><svg width=\"24\" h