ea5e18f8\" style=\"font-size:72px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Este INVIERNO Disfruta Participando en Dinámica de Suerte Virtual y Consigue un Premio!!!!</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-dark-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size gutenify-section-3ccef290-c173-11ef-8dbd-f5127a01e700 wp-elements-3586dbb07b1899248b83d0b3e2119215\">Juega, participa y gana con esta dinámica gana jugando y probando  tu suerte consigue un premio por participar ahora, si haciendo click en el botón de abajo.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-buttons is-content-justification-center wp-block-buttons gutenify-buttons-version-2 gutenify-section-fc058f60-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-button wp-block-button gutenify-button-version-2 gutenify-section-fc156de0-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be\"><a href=\" wa.link/n5iylt\" class=\"gutenify-button-link wp-block-button__link\"><span>Juega Invierno Virtual </span></a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull gutenify-section-aab473b0-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-66978850 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"><div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-advance-slider gutenify-advance-slider gutenify-section-aab31420-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be gutenify-section-layout-1 gutenify-advance-slider-version-2 alignfull\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-advance-slide-item gutenify-block-slide-item-wrapper swiper-slide gutenify-advance-slide-item-version-2 gutenify-section-aa9aaa20-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be\">\n<figure data-wp-context=\"{&quot;imageId&quot;:&quot;68376d832d2d1&quot;}\" data-wp-interactive=\"core/image\" class=\"wp-block-image size-full gutenify-section-aa98d560-f6f4-11ee-8eed-cf35b84f59be wp-lightbox-container\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1587\" height=\"2