-3c191340-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581\" style=\"font-size:72px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700\">Este INVIERNO Disfruta Participando en Dinámica de Suerte Virtual y Consigue un Premio!!!!</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"blockClientId\":\"34dd8eb0-c17e-11ef-aa70-1728e25d4fac\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|dark-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"dark-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"large\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-dark-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size gutenify-section-34dd8eb0-c17e-11ef-aa70-1728e25d4fac\">Juega, participa y gana con esta dinámica gana jugando y probando tu suerte consigue un premio por participar ahora, si haciendo click en el botón de abajo.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gutenify/buttons {\"blockClientId\":\"3c426d30-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581\",\"contentJustification\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-buttons is-content-justification-center wp-block-buttons gutenify-buttons-version-2 gutenify-section-3c426d30-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581\"><!-- wp:gutenify/button {\"blockClientId\":\"3c2dfad0-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581\",\"blockAdvanceOptions\":{\"buttonBorderRadius\":0,\"buttonBorderWidth\":0,\"textColor\":\"#000000\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#9261c6\",\"borderRadius\":\"50px\",\"margin\":{\"desktop\":{\"top\":\"50px\",\"bottom\":\"\"}},\"hoverTextColor\":\"#ffffff\",\"hoverBackgroundColor\":\"#fcb900\"},\"text\":\"Juega Invierno Virtual\",\"gutenifyStyles\":\".gutenify-section-3c2dfad0-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581 .gutenify-button-link { color: #000000;background: #9261c6;border-radius: 50px; }.gutenify-section-3c2dfad0-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581 .gutenify-button-link:hover { color: #ffffff;background: #fcb900; }.gutenify-section-3c2dfad0-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581 .gutenify-button-link { margin-top: 50px; }\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-gutenify-button wp-block-button gutenify-button-version-2 gutenify-section-3c2dfad0-c177-11ef-9cbc-c5fd21b6e581