ts tienen un costo de 5Bs</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"blockClientId\":\"8778e8f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"} -->\n<p class=\"gutenify-section-8778e8f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\">Compra tus tickets y participa totalmente en linea.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"blockClientId\":\"877b59f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"} -->\n<p class=\"gutenify-section-877b59f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\">Recibe tus Premios en casa y llega a otro nivel de la dinamica.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"blockClientId\":\"8782acf0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\",\"className\":\" animated animated-fadeInUp\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\"},\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons animated animated-fadeInUp gutenify-section-8782acf0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"background\",\"blockClientId\":\"878014e0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"35px\",\"left\":\"35px\"}}},\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline gutenify-section-878014e0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-right:35px;padding-left:35px\">Comprar Ticket </a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\",\"blockClientId\":\"4df90c80-8506-11ef-b179-e579a1574a26\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-bottom gutenify-section-4df90c80-8506-11ef-b179-e579a1574a26\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"bottom\",\"width\":\"100%\",\"blockClientId\":\"4dea1860-8506-11e