8b49-3f6b26196db1\">Participa de forma libre en la dinámica  haciendo una colaboración. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"blockClientId\":\"8778e8f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"} -->\n<p class=\"gutenify-section-8778e8f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\">Obtendrás beneficios y premio de un Miniset Model Bolivia. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"blockClientId\":\"877b59f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"} -->\n<p class=\"gutenify-section-877b59f0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\">Solo se parte de las Actividades de Model Bolivia </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"blockClientId\":\"8782acf0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\",\"className\":\" animated animated-fadeInUp\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"left\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons animated animated-fadeInUp gutenify-section-8782acf0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\" style=\"margin-top:20px;margin-bottom:20px\"><!-- wp:button {\"textColor\":\"background\",\"blockClientId\":\"878014e0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\",\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"0px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"35px\",\"left\":\"35px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline gutenify-section-878014e0-850a-11ef-8b49-3f6b26196db1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background-color has-text-color wp-element-button\" href=\"#\" style=\"border-radius:0px;padding-right:35px;padding-left:35px\">Hacer una Colaboracion</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"width\":\"750px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"blockClientId\":\"52d5ded0-c17f-11ef-aa70-1728e25d4fac\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized gutenify-section-52d5ded0-c17f-11ef-aa70-1728e25d4fac\"><img src=\"https://img1.picmix.com/output/pic